* The mean and the standard deviation of numbers that JOSS asks for.
1.1 Demand x(i).
1.2 Set s = s + x(i).

2.1 Set v = v + [x(i)-m]*2.

Set n = 6.
Set s = 0.
Do part 1 for i = 1(1)n.
    x(1) = 61.5
    x(2) = 64
    x(3) = 58.25
    x(4) = 70
    x(5) = 66.75
    x(6) = 63.5
Set m = s/n.
Set v = 0.
Do part 2 for i = 1(1)n.
Type m, sqrt[v/(n-1)].
       m =      64
sqrt[v/(n-1)] =  4.07737661
